FrostByte.app also contains the third-party software below, built from the
source releases pinned in config/sources.lock with the patches in patches/ and
deps/patches/. Each keeps its own licence. The full licence texts are in each
source release (the file named in the last column) and are copied into
FrostByte.app/Contents/Resources/Licenses/ by the packaging step.

Source: everything needed to rebuild FrostByte.app exactly is this repository
plus the upstream releases listed in config/sources.lock, which ./build.sh
downloads. For the components under the GNU LGPL, that is the corresponding
source the licence requires; you may also ask Jordan Bettcher for a copy. The
LGPL libraries are shipped as separate dynamic libraries in
FrostByte.app/Contents/Frameworks, so they can be replaced with modified
versions (relink by rebuilding them with this repository's scripts).

